{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.SpecAttr.isSpecInvariantType\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">isSpecInvariantType</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">env</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Environment</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ty</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `true` if `ty` is an application of a type tagged with `@[spec_invariant_type]`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.SpecAttr.isSpecInvariantType","kind":"def","line":727,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.SpecAttr.isSpecInvariantType","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L727-L734"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.SpecAttr.specInvariantAttr\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">specInvariantAttr</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Attributes.html#Lean.TagAttribute\">TagAttribute</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Marks a type as an invariant type for the `mvcgen` tactic.\nGoals whose type is an application of a tagged type will be classified\nas invariants rather than verification conditions.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.SpecAttr.specInvariantAttr","kind":"opaque","line":718,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.SpecAttr.specInvariantAttr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L718-L725"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.SpecAttr.mkSpecAttr\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkSpecAttr</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Attributes.html#Lean.AttributeImpl\">AttributeImpl</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.SpecAttr.mkSpecAttr","kind":"def","line":683,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.SpecAttr.mkSpecAttr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L683-L714"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.getSpecTheorems\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">getSpecTheorems</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecTheorems\">SpecTheorems</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.getSpecTheorems","kind":"def","line":676,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.getSpecTheorems","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L676-L677"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension.getTheorems\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecExtension</span>.<span class=\"name\">getTheorems</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ext</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension\">SpecExtension</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecTheorems\">SpecTheorems</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension.getTheorems","kind":"def","line":673,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension.getTheorems","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L673-L674"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.specAttr\"><span