"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension.addSpecTheoremFromLocal\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecExtension</span>.<span class=\"name\">addSpecTheoremFromLocal</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ext</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension\">SpecExtension</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">fvar</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">prio</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> := <span class=\"fn\">1000</span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension.addSpecTheoremFromLocal","kind":"def","line":661,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension.addSpecTheoremFromLocal","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L661-L664"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension.addSpecTheoremFromConst\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecExtension</span>.<span class=\"name\">addSpecTheoremFromConst</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ext</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension\">SpecExtension</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">prio</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">attrKind</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Attributes.html#Lean.AttributeKind\">AttributeKind</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension.addSpecTheoremFromConst","kind":"def","line":656,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension.addSpecTheoremFromConst","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L656-L659"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.specEraseProofs\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">specEraseProofs</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecProof\">SpecProof</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The spec proofs a `@[spec]` constant contributes to the database: the constant itself for a\n`Triple`/`⊑ wp` spec, the equation itself for an equational spec, or the specs its simp set\ncontributes for a definition registered to unfold. Mirrors `addSimpSpecTheoremsFromConst` so `[-foo]`\nerases exactly the entries that annotating `foo` inserted.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.specEraseProofs","kind":"def","line":639,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.specEraseProofs","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L639-L654"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension.addSimpSpecTheoremsFromConst\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecExtension</span>.<span class=\"name\">addSimpSpecTheoremsFromConst</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ext</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension\">SpecExtension</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">prio</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">attrKind</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Attributes.html#Lean.AttributeKind\">AttributeKind</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Register the equational lemmas of a `@[spec]`-annotated declaration as `.simp` entries with the\ngiven priority. An equational proposition is registered directly; a definition is registered via the\nspecs its simp entries contribute (`simpSpecTheorems`). Anything else throws, since it cannot serve as\na `vcgen` spec.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension.addSimpSpecTheoremsFromConst","kind":"def","line":621,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension.addSimpSpecTheoremsFromConst","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L621-L637"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.simpSpecTheorems\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpSpecTheorems</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">entries</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.SimpEntry\">Meta.SimpEntry</a></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">prio</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecTheorem\">SpecTheorem</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The spec theorems the simp entries `entries` contribute, the single place a `vcgen [...]` argument or\nan `attribute [spec] f` definition (through `mkSimpEntryOfDeclToUnfold`) turns into specs:\n- each `.thm` entry, keyed on its left-hand side at `prio`, skipping wildcard-row equations guarded\n  by an overlap hypothesis (as a spec such an equation matches any call and strands the hypothesis as\n  a verification condition). A declaration equation is keyed via `mkSpecTheoremFromSimpDecl?`; an\n  equation supplied as a `vcgen [...]` term carries its proof directly (`mkSpecTheoremFromSimpExpr?`),\n- each `.toUnfold` definition through its unfold theorem `f.eq_def` (`unfoldSpecEqn?`) at priority\n  `0`, below every equation, so a call with an opaque discriminant still rewrites to the underlying\n  `match` expression, which `vcgen` then splits.\nA single malformed entry is traced and skipped rather than aborting the set.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.simpSpecTheorems","kind":"def","line":576,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.simpSpecTheorems","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L576-L619"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.unfoldSpecEqn?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">unfoldSpecEqn?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The unfold theorem `declName.eq_def` through which a definition in a simp set's `toUnfold`\nrewrites, the spec-database counterpart of `simp`'s delta unfolding. `none` for a recursive\ndefinition, whose unconditional unfolding would not terminate.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.unfoldSpecEqn?","kind":"def","line":567,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.unfoldSpecEqn?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L567-L574"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromSimpExpr?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkSpecTheoremFromSimpExpr?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ref</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">proof</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">levelParams</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.nil\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.nil\">]</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">prio</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> := <span class=\"fn\">1000</span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecTheorem\">SpecTheorem</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Create a `SpecTheorem` from an elaborated equational proof term `proof : ∀ xs, lhs = rhs`, keyed on\nthe LHS. Mirrors `mkSpecTheoremFromSimpDecl?` for proofs supplied as terms rather than declaration\nnames. Returns `none` for a no-op equation whose LHS key equals its RHS.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromSimpExpr?","kind":"def","line":553,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromSimpExpr?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L553-L565"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromSimpDecl?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkSpecTheoremFromSimpDecl?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">prio</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecTheorem\">SpecTheorem</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Create a `SpecTheorem` from a simp/equational declaration `declName : ∀ xs, lhs = rhs`, keyed on the\nLHS. Function-level equations (e.g. class projection unfold lemmas) are eta-expanded so the\ndiscrimination-tree key includes all arguments. Returns `none` for no-op equations whose LHS key is\nsyntactically the RHS.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromSimpDecl?","kind":"def","line":537,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromSimpDecl?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L537-L551"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromStx\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkSpecTheoremFromStx</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ref</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">proof</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">prio</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> := <span class=\"fn\">1000</span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecTheorem\">SpecTheorem</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromStx","kind":"def","line":499,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromStx","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L499-L501"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromLocal\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkSpecTheoremFromLocal</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">fvar</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">prio</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> := <span class=\"fn\">1000</span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecTheorem\">SpecTheorem</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromLocal","kind":"def","line":495,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromLocal","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L495-L497"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromConst\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkSpecTheoremFromConst</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">prio</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> := <span class=\"fn\">1000</span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecTheorem\">SpecTheorem</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromConst","kind":"def","line":491,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecTheoremFromConst","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L491-L493"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecPatternFromExpr\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkSpecPatternFromExpr</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">expr</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">levelParams</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.nil\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.nil\">]</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Pattern.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Pattern\">Meta.Sym.Pattern</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Builds a `Sym.Pattern` keyed on the program selected by `selectProg` from a spec conclusion.\nThe conclusion is assumed to already be a valid spec shape (checked by the caller via `selectProg`);\na non-spec shape reaching here is a logic error and throws.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecPatternFromExpr","kind":"def","line":466,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.mkSpecPatternFromExpr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L466-L477"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.selectProg\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">selectProg</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">type</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Selects the program a spec conclusion is keyed on: the program of a `Triple`, or the program inside\nthe `wp` on the RHS of a `pre ⊑ wp …` entailment. Returns `none` if `type` is neither shape — e.g. a\nbare `lhs ⊑ rhs` whose RHS is not a `wp` application (an invariant entailment such as\n`(I n h).inv … ⊑ Q n r.2`, which can appear as an ordinary hypothesis but is not a spec). Callers use\n`none` to skip such non-spec hypotheses instead of failing.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.selectProg","kind":"def","line":447,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.selectProg","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L447-L464"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.progArgIdx?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">progArgIdx?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The application-argument index of `declName`'s program parameter `x`, read from its signature. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.progArgIdx?","kind":"def","line":439,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.progArgIdx?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L439-L445"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.eraseUnusedVarsFromPattern\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">eraseUnusedVarsFromPattern</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Pattern.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Pattern\">Meta.Sym.Pattern</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Pattern.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Pattern\">Meta.Sym.Pattern</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Drops pattern variables that the pattern expression does not depend on.\n\n`Sym.mkPatternFromExprWithKey`/`Sym.mkPatternFromDeclWithKey` turn *every* leading `∀`-binder of the\nsource type into a pattern variable, even binders the selected key (e.g. the program of a `Triple`\nconclusion) never mentions. During matching those variables only ever become fresh metavariables\n(see `Sym.mkPreResult`); for instance binders they additionally trigger spurious `trySynthInstance`\ncalls. This keeps only the variables that the pattern expression references, together with the\ntransitive closure of variables their types depend on, and renumbers the remaining de Bruijn\nindices. `varInfos?` and `checkTypeMask?` are filtered to the surviving telescope; `fnInfos`,\n`levelParams`, and the discrimination-tree key are unchanged because the pattern expression's\nstructure is untouched (bound variables are wildcards in the key).\n\n**Important:** only use this when the matched arguments are *not* reused to rebuild a proof term,\nas `Sym.BackwardRule`/`Sym.mkValue` do — dropping variables would drop arguments those need. It is\nmeant for databases such as `vcgen`'s spec table, where the proof is re-elaborated independently\nof the pattern.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.eraseUnusedVarsFromPattern","kind":"def","line":383,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.eraseUnusedVarsFromPattern","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.lean#L383-L437"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Attr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.SpecExtension\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecExtension</